@startuml whiteboard-sync
title Доска: durable ack, snapshot -> live и компакция
actor "Client A" as a
actor "Client B" as b
participant "Realtime #1" as rt1
participant "Realtime #2" as rt2
database "realtime_db" as db
queue "Redis Pub/Sub" as redis
participant "Node compactor" as comp
== Append ==
a -> rt1: board.update(update_id, blob)
group Одна DB transaction
  rt1 -> db: lock board_rooms; check receipt/digest
  rt1 -> db: increment last_seq; INSERT update + receipt
end
rt1 --> a: board.ack(update_id, seq) после commit
rt1 -> redis: publish(seq, blob)
redis -> rt2: best-effort delivery
rt2 -> b: board.update(seq, blob)
== Snapshot -> live ==
b -> rt2: sync_request / reconnect
rt2 -> redis: subscribe; ждать подтверждения; buffer live
rt2 -> db: consistent snapshot + tail до H=last_seq
rt2 --> b: snapshot, upto_seq, tail, H
rt2 --> b: buffered updates seq > H
b -> rt2: повтор pending updates с прежними ID
== Потеря последнего publish без разрыва WS ==
rt2 -> db: heartbeat: durable last_seq
rt2 -> b: board.watermark(last_seq)
b -> rt2: gap -> sync_request
== Компакция ==
comp -> db: consistent snapshot + tail до H
comp -> comp: apply to Y.Doc; GC; encodeStateAsUpdate
group Одна DB transaction
  comp -> db: lock rooms; проверить исходное поколение
  comp -> db: INSERT verified snapshot(H); update snapshot_seq
  comp -> db: удалить покрытые updates <= H
end
note over db,comp
  last_seq и receipts не сбрасываются.
  Snapshot после pruning — часть источника истины.
  Конкурирующие updates > H сохраняются.
end note
@enduml
